Upstream-Status: Inappropriate

Subject: [PATCH] sched/isolation: Log each strict isolcpus= flag at boot

Print one line per strict flag accepted from isolcpus=, so the boot log
shows which ones are in effect.
---
--- a/kernel/sched/isolation.c
+++ b/kernel/sched/isolation.c
@@ -240,6 +240,7 @@ static int __init housekeeping_isolcpus_
 		}
 		if (i < ISOL_STRICT_MAX) {
 			__set_bit(i, &isolcpus_strict);
+			pr_info("isolcpus: Strict flag %s\n", isolcpus_strict_names[i]);
 			str += len + 1;
 			continue;
 		}
